the program. ESA is expected to make a formal decision by June, and that choice will significantly

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:28.720
shape Europe's role in Artemis going forward. It's a reminder of just how interconnected this

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:33.460
international effort really is. One partner's budget reality ripples through everyone else's

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:38.100
planning. I'll be watching closely to see how Europe pivots whether they double down on surface

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.820
elements or find new ways to contribute from orbit. Back in low-earth orbit, NASA is also getting

