00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:10.960
quietly delivering practical advances that benefit everything from satellite design to future crude

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:16.540
exploration. It's the kind of steady, unglamorous progress that compounds over time.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:22.220
While those experiments look down at Earth, another group of scientists is looking up at where we

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:28.020
hope to walk next. Ten participating scientists have been selected to help shape the Artemis lunar

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:33.620
surface science plan with a particular focus on the South Polar region. Their expertise will guide

